# Cloudflare Workers asset exclusion list
# Uses Cloudflare's canonical pattern format with **/ prefix

# CRITICAL — exclude all git internals (this is what's breaking the build)
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes

# Build/config files
**/.assetsignore
**/wrangler.jsonc
**/package.json
**/package-lock.json
**/node_modules

# Source files (kept in repo, not deployed)
**/site_generator.py
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc

# Documentation (kept in repo, not deployed)
**/MANIFEST.md
**/MANIFEST.txt
**/README.md
**/README-UPLOAD.txt

# System cruft
**/.DS_Store
**/.vscode
**/.idea
